== Gameplay Notes ==
*Cannot be sold for rupies, reduced or used for upgrading.
*Only one copy can ever be obtained.
*{{PAGENAME}}'s associated [[Arcarum_Evokers|Arcarum Evoker]] is {{Itm|Evoker|arcarum={{{arcarum|}}}}}.

=== Sephira Maxi-{{WeaponElement|{{{element|}}}}} ===
* [[Weapon Skills#Damage Cap Up|20% boost to damage cap]] to {{WeaponElement|{{{element|}}}}} allies when in [[Arcarum: The World Beyond]] and [[Replicard Sandbox]].
** This is not part of the 20% cap on weapon skills, such as the ones found on {{itm|Scales of Dominion}} and {{itmGSI|title=Malus weapons|Ray of Zhuque Malus|Xuanwu Mace Malus|Baihu Claw Malus|Qinglong Spear Malus}}.
** Multiple Sephira Maxi-{{WeaponElement|{{{element|}}}}} skills do not stack.<ref>Kiss of The Devil and Heat of The Sun stacking test https://twitter.com/masa31507500/status/1338840120196096001</ref>
* At level 200, {{WeaponElement|{{{element|}}}}} allies gain [[Weapon Skills#Damage Cap Up|5% damage cap up]].
** This boost to damage cap stacks additively with general damage cap weapon skill sources, such as {{Itm|All-Might Battle-Axe}}, {{Itm|Scales of Dominion}}, {{Itm|Pain and Suffering}}, and {{ItmGSI|title=Cosmos Weapons|Cosmic Sword|Cosmic Dagger|Cosmic Lance|Cosmic Scythe|Cosmic Rod|Cosmic Rifle|Cosmic Gauntlet|Cosmic Bow|Cosmic Harp|Cosmic Blade}}, up to a maximum of 20%.<ref name="way_way_way, Culmination of Nightfall stacking">way_way_way, Culmination of Nightfall stacking. https://twitter.com/way_way_way/status/1159993970820169728</ref>
** Stacks additively with damage cap boosts such as {{Status|DMG Cap Boosted}}, Extended Mastery Perks, character Support Skills, and most [[:Category:Archangel_Series_Summons|Archangel Series Summons]]'s Sub Auras.<ref name="firemagma">firemagma, https://twitter.com/firemagma/status/851444871684472832</ref>
